do_not:
  - Create agent-file-handoff/Archive/ as default memory.
  - Store durable reports inside .uai/long-term-memory.uai.
  - Claim trained-quality model behavior, GGUF import, Mini Browser automation, WebGPU acceleration, or remote inference support from report memory alone.
  - Store report bodies in .uai/short-term-memory.uai; it should route to durable report/research nodes and the long-term pointer ledger.
  - Claim trained LoRA support, broader adapter formats, or population training until implementation and tests exist.
